Song brief: Dark atmospheric indie/alternative. Influences: Radiohead Kid A, Portishead trip-hop, Nine Inch Nails The Fragile. Sparse keys, deep bass, atmospheric pads. Drums enter at chorus. Lo-fi crackle in verse, clean/wide in chorus.
